{"pageProps":{"source":"<p>Le triangle cognitif (cognitive triangle en anglais) est un modèle utilisé en <a href=\"/tcc\" title=\"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale\">Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale</a> qui illustre la relation entre nos pensées, nos émotions et nos comportements.</p>\n\n\n<div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"pele pele-flowchart\" viewBox=\"0 0 462 92\" width=\"462\" height=\"92\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;--_bg:var(--pele-bg,#fff);--_fg:var(--pele-fg,#1f1f1f);--_m:var(--pele-muted,#6e6e6e);--_l:var(--pele-line,#1f1f1f);--_s:var(--pele-surface,#f3f3f3);--_a:var(--pele-surface-alt,#e6e6e6);--_b:var(--pele-border,#8a8a8a);--_c:var(--pele-accent,#5b7bd5);color:var(--_fg);--_r:var(--pele-radius,4px);--_fm:var(--pele-font-mono,monospace);font:16px sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;direction:ltr;font-family:var(--pele-font,sans-serif)\" fill=\"var(--_fg)\" role=\"graphics-document document\" aria-roledescription=\"flowchart\"><g class=\"pele-edges\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--_l)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><g class=\"pele-edge\" data-id=\"L_A_B_0\"><path d=\"M113.64,50L119.64,50C130.64,50 130.64,32 141.64,32L147.64,32\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M106.64,50L114.64,46.64L114.64,53.36Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M154.64,32L146.64,35.36L146.64,28.64Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/></g><g class=\"pele-edge\" data-id=\"L_B_C_0\"><path d=\"M262.94,32L268.94,32C279.94,32 279.94,50 290.94,50L296.94,50\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M255.94,32L263.94,28.64L263.94,35.36Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M303.94,50L295.94,53.36L295.94,46.64Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/></g><g class=\"pele-edge\" data-id=\"L_C_A_0\"><path d=\"M296.94,66L290.94,66C273.44,66 273.44,84 255.94,84L154.64,84C137.14,84 137.14,66 119.64,66L113.64,66\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M303.94,66L295.94,69.36L295.94,62.64Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/><path class=\"pele-marker\" d=\"M106.64,66L114.64,62.64L114.64,69.36Z\" fill=\"var(--_l)\" stroke=\"none\"/></g></g><g class=\"pele-nodes\"><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"A\" transform=\"translate(57.32,58)\"><rect x=\"-49.32\" y=\"-24\" width=\"98.64\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pensées</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"B\" transform=\"translate(205.29,32)\"><rect x=\"-50.65\" y=\"-24\" width=\"101.3\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Émotions</text></g><g class=\"pele-node pele-shape-rect\" data-id=\"C\" transform=\"translate(378.84,58)\"><rect x=\"-74.9\" y=\"-24\" width=\"149.81\" height=\"48\" fill=\"var(--_s)\" stroke=\"var(--_b)\" style=\"rx:var(--_r)\"/><text class=\"pele-label\" x=\"0\" y=\"5.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Comportements</text></g></g></svg></div>\n\nIl est basé sur l'idée que ces trois éléments sont interdépendants et s'influencent mutuellement :\n\n*   Nos pensées influencent nos émotions et nos comportements\n*   Nos émotions influencent nos pensées et nos comportements\n*   Nos comportements influencent nos pensées et nos émotions\n\nSi l'un de ces éléments change, cela peut influencer les deux autres.\n\nEt l'élément le plus facile à changer est la pensée.\n\nEn changeant nos pensées, nous pouvons changer les émotions et les comportements qui en découlent.\n\nPour cela, nous pouvons utiliser plusieurs techniques :\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/restructuration-cognitive\" title=\"Restructuration cognitive\" class=\"not-found\">Restructuration cognitive</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/methode-socratique\" title=\"Méthode socratique\" class=\"not-found\">Méthode socratique</a></p>\n\n*   <p><a href=\"/journal-de-pensees\" title=\"Journal de pensées\">Journal de pensées</a></p>\n\n\n***\n\nRéférences :\n\n*   <https://i.imgur.com/zLgt3bF.png>\n*   <https://x.com/george__mack/status/1721117741057220859>\n*   <https://therapistaid.com/therapy-worksheet/cbt-triangle>\n*   <https://hudsontherapygroup.com/blog/cognitive-triangle>\n","isIndex":false,"url":"https://johackim.com/triangle-cognitif","mocs":[{"emoji":"💻","title":"Programmation","permalink":"programmation"},{"emoji":"🧠","title":"Psychologie","permalink":"psychologie"},{"emoji":"🎒","title":"Indie hacker","permalink":"indie-hacker"},{"emoji":"🔮","title":"Obsidian","permalink":"obsidian"},{"emoji":"🐧","title":"Linux","permalink":"linux"},{"emoji":"🐳","title":"Docker","permalink":"docker"},{"emoji":"⚡️","title":"Productivité","permalink":"productivite"},{"emoji":"🥷","title":"Cybersécurité","permalink":"cybersecurite"},{"emoji":"🛡️","title":"Vie privée","permalink":"vie-privee"},{"emoji":"📚","title":"Livres","permalink":"livres"},{"emoji":"🗺️","title":"Modèles mentaux","permalink":"modeles-mentaux"}],"graph":{"nodes":[{"id":"Journal de pensées","title":"Journal de pensées","href":"/journal-de-pensees","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Mindfulness","title":"Mindfulness","href":"/mindfulness","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Psychologie","title":"🧠 Psychologie","href":"/psychologie","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"The Cognitive Triangle","title":"Le triangle cognitif","href":"/triangle-cognitif","isUnresolved":false},{"id":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale","title":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale","href":"/tcc","isUnresolved":false}],"links":[{"source":"Journal de pensées","target":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale"},{"source":"Mindfulness","target":"The Cognitive Triangle"},{"source":"Psychologie","target":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale"},{"source":"Psychologie","target":"The Cognitive Triangle"},{"source":"Psychologie","target":"Journal de pensées"},{"source":"Psychologie","target":"Mindfulness"},{"source":"The Cognitive Triangle","target":"Thérapie cognitivo-comportementale"},{"source":"The Cognitive Triangle","target":"Journal de pensées"}],"activeId":"The Cognitive Triangle"},"file":"The Cognitive Triangle.md","fileName":"The Cognitive Triangle","title":"Le triangle cognitif","description":"Le triangle cognitif est un modèle utilisé en TCC qui illustre la relation entre nos pensées, nos émotions et nos comportements.","comments":true,"permalink":"triangle-cognitif","aliases":"[CBT Triangle, Triangle cognitif]","datePublished":"2024-05-20T10:00:00","dateUpdated":"2024-05-20T10:00:00","publish":true,"rss":true,"rating":"5"},"__N_SSG":true}